    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. INSTALL 2-3 SHIFT VALVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Install the 2-3 shift valve and spring.",
        "(b) Install the plug into the bore.",
        "(c) Coat the retainer with petroleum jelly and install it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Installation of rear clutch sequence valve with spring and plug, showing petroleum jelly application to pin",
      "labels": [
